sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Server
    participant Molu as molu (Front MCP)
    participant Telemetry as Telemetry Server (puerto 9090)
    participant Health as Health Check
    participant Metrics as Metrics Collector
    participant Xolu as xolu Sustrato

    Note over Prometheus, Xolu: === METRICAS Y HEALTH CHECK ===

    Note over Prometheus, Telemetry: === SCRAPE METRICAS (cada 15-30s) ===
    Prometheus->>Telemetry: HTTP GET /metrics
    Telemetry->>Metrics: Recopila contadores e histogramas
    Metrics-->>Telemetry: Formato Prometheus text
    Telemetry-->>Prometheus: 200 OK + text/plain

    Note over Telemetry, Metrics: === CONTADORES ===
    Metrics->>Metrics: molu_requests_total{component, method, tool, code}
    Metrics->>Metrics: molu_errors_total{component, code}
    Metrics->>Metrics: molu_latency_seconds_bucket{component, method, le}

    Note over Prometheus, Health: === HEALTH CHECK (K8s liveness/readiness) ===
    Prometheus->>Health: HTTP GET /healthz (cada 10-30s)
    Health->>Health: Verifica cache 30s (ultimo ping xolu exitoso)
    Health->>Xolu: Ping (si cache expirado)
    Xolu-->>Health: 200 OK / Error
    Health->>Health: Actualiza estado xolu (available/stale/unavailable)
    Health-->>Prometheus: 200 OK (status ok) / 503 (degraded/down)

    Note over Health, Xolu: === ESTADOS HEALTH ===
    alt xolu ping < 30s
        Health->>Prometheus: 200 OK {status: "ok", checks.xolu.status: "available"}
    else xolu ping > 30s o nunca
        Health->>Prometheus: 503 {status: "degraded", checks.xolu.status: "stale"}
    else proceso apagandose
        Health->>Prometheus: 503 {status: "down"}
    end

    Note over Molu, Xolu: === PING PERIODICO XOLU (cada 10s) ===
    loop Cada 10s
        Molu->>Xolu: Ping (con headers X-Request-ID, X-Trace-ID)
        Xolu-->>Molu: 200 OK / Error
        Molu->>Metrics: ObserveLatency("xolu-client", "ping", latency_ms)
        alt Ping OK
            Molu->>Health: SetXoluStatus(true, now)
            Health->>Health: Cache 30s
        else Ping Falla
            Molu->>Health: SetXoluStatus(false, now)  // No actualiza lastSuccessPing
        end
    end

    Note over Molu, Xolu: === ARRANQUE CON BACKOFF ===
    Molu->>Xolu: Ping (intento 1)
    alt xolu OK
        Xolu-->>Molu: 200 OK
        Molu->>Health: SetXoluStatus(true, now)
        Molu->>Molu: Inicia servidor MCP
    else xolu caido
        Xolu-->>Molu: Error/Timeout
        Molu->>Molu: Espera backoff (1s -> 30s exponencial)
        Molu->>Xolu: Ping (intento 2)
        alt ... hasta MAX_ATTEMPTS
            Xolu-->>Molu: Error
        else Recuperado
            Xolu-->>Molu: 200 OK
            Molu->>Health: SetXoluStatus(true, now)
            Molu->>Molu: Inicia servidor MCP
        else Agotado MAX_ATTEMPTS
            Molu->>Logger: system.log ERROR SUBSTRATE_UNAVAILABLE con RetryMetadata
            Molu->>Molu: Exit 1
        end
    end

    Note over Prometheus, Metrics: === ALERTAS RECOMENDADAS ===
    Prometheus->>Prometheus: rate(molu_errors_total[5m]) / rate(molu_requests_total[5m]) > 0.05
    Prometheus->>Prometheus: histogram_quantile(0.99, molu_latency_seconds_bucket) > 1s
    Prometheus->>Prometheus: increase(molu_errors_total{code="SUBSTRATE_UNAVAILABLE"}[5m]) > 0

    Note over Telemetry, Molu: === PUERTOS ===
    Telemetry-->>Red: Puerto 9090 (HTTP /metrics, /healthz)
    Molu-->>Red: Puerto MCP (ej. 8080) transporte stdio/HTTP
    Xolu-->>Red: Puerto 8080 (HTTP /walk, /find, /get, /ping)